 instalação." • Produto novo, original e com nota fiscal.', 49.97, 49.97, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Filters', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rfhp-m96j9wokrus137', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1343288194%2F23093951113', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
