', 227.9, 182.32, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Motorcycles > Chassis', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rd75-m78d1w3up8yxc3', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F316500472%2F27229235512', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
