te: MA20041 - Código EAN: 9001616712364 - Marca: MAM Imagens meramente ilustrativas, as cores e estampas podem variar de acordo com o lote do fabricante.', 299.99, 299.99, NULL, 'Mom & Baby > Feeding Essentials > Bottle-feeding', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7qukw-lgmchn1l0nsl07', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F340054154%2F17740553381', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
